Below is a minimal example of a rotating card using only HTML and CSS.  
When you hover over the card, it will rotate 180 degrees around its Y‑axis.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pl">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Rotating Card</title>
<style>
  .card-wrapper {
    perspective: 1000px;          /* gives depth to the 3D effect */
    width: 300px;
    height: 200px;
    margin: 50px auto;
  }

  .card {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    position: relative;
    transform-style: preserve-3d;   /* allows children to be positioned in 3D space */
    transition: transform 0.6s ease; /* smooth rotation */
  }

  .card:hover {
    transform: rotateY(180deg);     /* rotate on hover */
  }

  /* Front side of the card */
  .card .front,
  .card .back {
    position: absolute;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    backface-visibility: hidden;   /* hide backside when rotated */
    border-radius: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
  }

  .card .front {
    background: #fff;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: #333;
  }

  .card .back {
    background: #f8f8f8;
    transform: rotateY(180deg);     /* flip the back side */
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: #555;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="card-wrapper">
  <div class="card">
    <div class="front">
      Front Side
    </div>
    <div class="back">
      Back Side
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
```

### How it works
- **`.card-wrapper`** sets a perspective so the 3D rotation looks realistic.
- **`.card`** is the container that will rotate. `transform-style: preserve-3d` allows its children to maintain 3D positioning.
- **`.front`** and **`.back`** are the two sides of the card. `backface-visibility: hidden` hides the side that is turned away from the viewer.
- On hover, the `.card` element rotates 180 degrees around the Y‑axis, revealing the back side.

Feel free to replace the text or add images, colors, or other styles to suit your design.
